-- Fresh worktree on bench/harness with nothing merged yet. Dry-run merge-tree showed conflicts only in EXPERIMENT.md, PROGRESS.md and a few source files (src/query/patterns/triple.rs where the batched join meets a storage layout; src/db_value.rs and src/node.rs where columnar meets sparse-matrix).
